    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808578,
    "RowId": 42300,
    "Text": "Upon my blade I swear, no harm shall come to Her Highness!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808650,
    "RowId": 42301,
    "Text": "You will not defile Zelenia's memory any longer!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808710,
    "RowId": 42302,
    "Text": "Try this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808730,
    "RowId": 42303,
    "Text": "No quarter!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808754,
    "RowId": 42304,
    "Text": "Vermin!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808774,
    "RowId": 42305,
    "Text": "Taste my steel!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808802,
    "RowId": 42306,
    "Text": "Have at you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808826,
    "RowId": 42307,
    "Text": "Fall!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808842,
    "RowId": 42308,
    "Text": "Rain down!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808866,
    "RowId": 42309,
    "Text": "Burst!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808886,
    "RowId": 42310,
    "Text": "Pierce!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808906,
    "RowId": 42311,
    "Text": "Feel the sting of my divine blade!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808954,
    "RowId": 42312,
    "Text": "Rage and roil!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 808982,
    "RowId": 42313,
    "Text": "I know this technique... You must keep moving!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809042,
    "RowId": 42314,
    "Text": "Heavens roar!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809066,
    "RowId": 42315,
    "Text": "That her bladework should be recreated so faithfully..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809134,
    "RowId": 42316,
    "Text": "Have care! Zelenia was capable of much, much more!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809198,
    "RowId": 42317,
    "Text": "Power fill my blade!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809230,
    "RowId": 42318,
    "Text": "I will show you the soul of a royal knight!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809286,
    "RowId": 42319,
    "Text": "For the honor and glory of Alexandria, I strike!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809346,
    "RowId": 42320,
    "Text": "This is her deadliest technique...but you must endure!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809414,
    "RowId": 42321,
    "Text": "Behold the essence of my art!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809454,
    "RowId": 42322,
    "Text": "You've no time even to fear my wrath!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809502,
    "RowId": 42323,
    "Text": "There is no escape!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809534,
    "RowId": 42324,
    "Text": "Surge!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809554,
    "RowId": 42325,
    "Text": "Quickly, away from the sigils!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809598,
    "RowId": 42326,
    "Text": "The sigils channel magic! Be on your guard!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809654,
    "RowId": 42327,
    "Text": "You must brace for blade and magic both!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809706,
    "RowId": 42328,
    "Text": "Amazing... You withstood Zelenia's bladework!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809762,
    "RowId": 42329,
    "Text": "You must take care when avoiding the sigils!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809818,
    "RowId": 42330,
    "Text": "I have pledged my life to the kingdom!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809870,
    "RowId": 42331,
    "Text": "My resolve shall never waver!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809910,
    "RowId": 42332,
    "Text": "You're no match for me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809946,
    "RowId": 42333,
    "Text": "Ignorant fools."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 809974,
    "RowId": 42334,
    "Text": "No more games!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 810002,
    "RowId": 42335,
    "Text": "I will suffer none to threaten Alexandria!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 810058,
    "RowId": 42336,
    "Text": "I am sworn to protect my queen! I will die before I yield!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 810130,
    "RowId": 42337,
    "Text": "That's right... Zelenia was always there to protect me..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 810198,
    "RowId": 42338,
    "Text": "I know this is merely a reconstruction...and yet..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 810262,
    "RowId": 42339,
    "Text": "For the honor and glory of Alexandria, I strike!"
  },
  {
