  {
    "RowOffset": 813290,
    "RowId": 42500,
    "Text": "Clear Ronfaure"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813318,
    "RowId": 42501,
    "Text": "Clear Horlais Peak"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813350,
    "RowId": 42502,
    "Text": "Clear armada airship"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813382,
    "RowId": 42503,
    "Text": "Clear Qufim"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813406,
    "RowId": 42504,
    "Text": "Clear the Stellar Fulcrum"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813442,
    "RowId": 42505,
    "Text": "Clear the Celestial Nexus"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813478,
    "RowId": 42506,
    "Text": "Chateau d'Oraguille...? Is this meant to be San d'Oria?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813546,
    "RowId": 42507,
    "Text": "Ronfaure is supposed to be a quiet place that sees its fair share of new adventurers..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813646,
    "RowId": 42508,
    "Text": "A burning circle, here? It would appear the land has been altered..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813726,
    "RowId": 42509,
    "Text": "This is Horlais Peak... We must be ready for anything."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813794,
    "RowId": 42510,
    "Text": "It seems we've impressed Kirin! Let us keep up the good work!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813866,
    "RowId": 42511,
    "Text": "The Jeuno Armada. But what is there to gain from recreating this battle?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 813950,
    "RowId": 42512,
    "Text": "It's Ultima and Omega! And they're attacking those airships!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814022,
    "RowId": 42513,
    "Text": "Ultima and Omega are on a rampage... Who unleashed them?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814090,
    "RowId": 42514,
    "Text": "I do not see an easy way back... But I'm sure you can handle things without me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814182,
    "RowId": 42515,
    "Text": "At this rate, everything will be laid to waste..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814242,
    "RowId": 42516,
    "Text": "しばらく合流は難しそうだ……！\nすまないが、そいつらを止めてくれ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814354,
    "RowId": 42517,
    "Text": "...But it would appear I've landed on the wrong airship."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814422,
    "RowId": 42518,
    "Text": "An impressive show. Hurry, now─do not keep me waiting."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814490,
    "RowId": 42519,
    "Text": "You shall find me at the summit."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814534,
    "RowId": 42520,
    "Text": "Farewell, my little brother. Return to the crystal from which you were born."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814622,
    "RowId": 42521,
    "Text": "You have the privilege of walking within the heart of Tu'Lia. Do <i>not</i> disappoint me."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814726,
    "RowId": 42522,
    "Text": "Come, then. Show me what your kind can do."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814782,
    "RowId": 42523,
    "Text": "Behold the glory of the Zilart."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814826,
    "RowId": 42524,
    "Text": "You are naught but insects to be crushed."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814878,
    "RowId": 42525,
    "Text": "O Sublime Estoc, drink deep of the elements!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814934,
    "RowId": 42526,
    "Text": "Once more, shall we?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 814966,
    "RowId": 42527,
    "Text": "Careful, now. The face of war is ever-changing!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815026,
    "RowId": 42528,
    "Text": "Kneel before Zilartian wisdom and die."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815078,
    "RowId": 42529,
    "Text": "This is the power of crystals. Transcendent. Sublime!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815142,
    "RowId": 42530,
    "Text": "By their might, I pave the path to Paradise!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815198,
    "RowId": 42531,
    "Text": "I am the will of the crystal!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815238,
    "RowId": 42532,
    "Text": "さらばだ、道化の猿どもよ。\nおまえたちの役目は終わった、世界の終わりが始まるのだ。"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815374,
    "RowId": 42533,
    "Text": "That you should still stand... Very well, then!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815434,
    "RowId": 42534,
    "Text": "I thank you for this amusement!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815478,
    "RowId": 42535,
    "Text": "Wh-Why? I am the will...of the crystal... How could I be defeated by mere mortals...?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815574,
    "RowId": 42536,
    "Text": "As for the rest of you, I invite you to the Gate of the Gods."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815646,
    "RowId": 42537,
    "Text": "You, who have risen above your mortal status... I am Kirin."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815718,
    "RowId": 42538,
    "Text": "Kirin could never be summoned here. More meddling from that fiend Sareel Ja, no doubt."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815818,
    "RowId": 42539,
    "Text": "I must thank you, mortals..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815858,
    "RowId": 42540,
    "Text": "O guardians divine, lend me now your might!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815914,
    "RowId": 42541,
    "Text": "O Suzaku, conjure your infernal flames!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 815966,
    "RowId": 42542,
    "Text": "O Seiryu, scatter blood upon the wind!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816018,
    "RowId": 42543,
    "Text": "O Byakko, rend with fang and claw!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816066,
    "RowId": 42544,
    "Text": "O Genbu, entomb in rock and earth!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816114,
    "RowId": 42545,
    "Text": "The divine beasts? Have care!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816154,
    "RowId": 42546,
    "Text": "This surging power, I bring to bear!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816202,
    "RowId": 42547,
    "Text": "This is no power I've seen before... But I won't be daunted!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816274,
    "RowId": 42548,
    "Text": "試練を与える。"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816306,
    "RowId": 42549,
    "Text": "頭を垂れよ。"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816338,
    "RowId": 42550,
    "Text": "Render up yourselves in tribute!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816382,
    "RowId": 42551,
    "Text": "You shall reap the rewards for daring to contend with the gods!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816458,
    "RowId": 42552,
    "Text": "There is no escape!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816490,
    "RowId": 42553,
    "Text": "Hah, nary a scratch! Well done!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816534,
    "RowId": 42554,
    "Text": "A comrade is in trouble! Someone heal them!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816590,
    "RowId": 42555,
    "Text": "A comrade is down! Someone revive them!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816642,
    "RowId": 42556,
    "Text": "A truly mighty blow! The adventurers of your world are extraordinary indeed!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816730,
    "RowId": 42557,
    "Text": "Such potent healing! My thanks!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816774,
    "RowId": 42558,
    "Text": "Such adamant defense... Our unbreakable resolve made manifest!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816850,
    "RowId": 42559,
    "Text": "I fear I cannot shield against this assault alone. Shields, with me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816930,
    "RowId": 42560,
    "Text": "This world shall belong to the Zilart."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 816982,
    "RowId": 42561,
    "Text": "All pales before our brilliance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817026,
    "RowId": 42562,
    "Text": "Can you escape this, I wonder."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817070,
    "RowId": 42563,
    "Text": "Allow me to show you a trick I've learned!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817126,
    "RowId": 42564,
    "Text": "Even in this false flesh, I will not lose to you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817186,
    "RowId": 42565,
    "Text": "You fought well, but it's time to say good-bye."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817246,
    "RowId": 42566,
    "Text": "This is not Vana'diel. I'm well aware of that."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817306,
    "RowId": 42567,
    "Text": "I also understand the true nature of my existence. So come, let us finish this."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817398,
    "RowId": 42568,
    "Text": "I will eliminate you and make this world ours!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817458,
    "RowId": 42569,
    "Text": "The time for games is over. Behold my true power!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817518,
    "RowId": 42570,
    "Text": "I shall forge a more fitting stage for our battle."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 817582,
    "RowId": 42571,
    "Text": "I do so hope you'll live up to my expectations."
  },
